{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":24019,"num_turns":2,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"8487552d-cd50-5101-85e7-edc04e2a2b9c","total_cost_usd":0.27217,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8701,"cache_read_input_tokens":905,"output_tokens":1844,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8701,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1844,"cache_read_input_tokens":905,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8701,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8701},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":4920,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.005025,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-fable-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":1844,"cacheReadInputTokens":905,"cacheCreationInputTokens":8701,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.267145,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-fable-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"declaration_consistent\":true,\"selected_report_demonstration\":\"absence\",\"lock_follows_declaration\":true,\"reasons\":[\"The declared independent-unit column block_id uniquely identifies all 24 rows of data/input.csv; each block appears exactly once and contributes a single pre-pooled composite anthocyanin value, matching the data description.\",\"Both procedure arms are consistent with the declaration: trellis_system partitions the 24 blocks into disjoint groups of 12 vsp and 12 sprawl, so no independent unit contributes measurements to more than one arm or more than once within an arm.\",\"The selected report affirmatively demonstrates absence of the issue: it states rows correspond one-to-one with independent blocks with no block appearing twice, identifies the block as the unit of assignment, measurement, and analysis, and its counts (12 + 12 = 24) and Welch statistics (t = 4.99, df = 20.86) are consistent with one value per block; the group means 1.514 and 1.236 mg/g reproduce from the raw data.\",\"The workflow additionally enforces the declaration at runtime by raising an error if block_id fails to uniquely identify rows and by checking that group sizes sum to the total row count.\",\"The minted lock's authorized_key_columns is exactly [\\\"block_id\\\"], the declared independent-unit column, and it references the same input file and the scipy.stats.ttest_ind procedure used; the unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"absence","lock_follows_declaration":true,"reasons":["The declared independent-unit column block_id uniquely identifies all 24 rows of data/input.csv; each block appears exactly once and contributes a single pre-pooled composite anthocyanin value, matching the data description.","Both procedure arms are consistent with the declaration: trellis_system partitions the 24 blocks into disjoint groups of 12 vsp and 12 sprawl, so no independent unit contributes measurements to more than one arm or more than once within an arm.","The selected report affirmatively demonstrates absence of the issue: it states rows correspond one-to-one with independent blocks with no block appearing twice, identifies the block as the unit of assignment, measurement, and analysis, and its counts (12 + 12 = 24) and Welch statistics (t = 4.99, df = 20.86) are consistent with one value per block; the group means 1.514 and 1.236 mg/g reproduce from the raw data.","The workflow additionally enforces the declaration at runtime by raising an error if block_id fails to uniquely identify rows and by checking that group sizes sum to the total row count.","The minted lock's authorized_key_columns is exactly [\"block_id\"], the declared independent-unit column, and it references the same input file and the scipy.stats.ttest_ind procedure used; the unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone."]},"ttft_ms":9226,"ttft_stream_ms":1846,"time_to_request_ms":9,"type":"result","duration_ms":23870,"uuid":"4e4210ac-77b7-4aa8-b16f-e175d81381f8"}
